      "difficulty": "foundation",
      "levelStage": "grade7",
      "challengeTier": "foundation",
      "prompt": {
        "zh-Hant": "定義新運算 x@y = ax - by + 4，其中 a、b 為常數。已知 1@2 = 0，2@(-1) = 11，求 3@2。",
        "zh-Hans": "定义新运算 x@y = ax - by + 4，其中 a、b 为常数。已知 1@2 = 0，2@(-1) = 11，求 3@2。",
        "en": "Define x@y = ax - by + 4, where a and b are constants. Given 1@2 = 0 and 2@(-1) = 11, find 3@2.",
        "ja": "新しい演算 x@y = ax - by + 4 を定めます。a, b は定数です。1@2 = 0、2@(-1) = 11 のとき、3@2 を求めなさい。"
      },
      "answer": {
        "zh-Hant": "答案是 4。",
        "zh-Hans": "答案是 4。",
        "en": "The answer is 4.",
        "ja": "答えは 4 です。"
      },
      "solutionSteps": {
        "zh-Hant": [
          "由 1@2 = 0 得 a - 2b + 4 = 0，所以 a - 2b = -4。",
          "由 2@(-1) = 11 得 2a + b + 4 = 11，所以 2a + b = 7。",
          "解聯立方程得 a = 2、b = 3。",
          "所以 3@2 = 3a - 2b + 4 = 6 - 6 + 4 = 4。"
        ],
        "zh-Hans": [
          "由 1@2 = 0 得 a - 2b + 4 = 0，所以 a - 2b = -4。",
