          "解联立方程得 a = 2、b = 3。",
          "所以 3@2 = 3a - 2b + 4 = 6 - 6 + 4 = 4。"
        ],
        "en": [
          "From 1@2 = 0, we get a - 2b = -4.",
          "From 2@(-1) = 11, we get 2a + b = 7.",
          "Solving gives a = 2 and b = 3.",
          "Then 3@2 = 3a - 2b + 4 = 4."
